  "goodToKnow": "Idyllisch means idyllic: idyllisch gelegen, ein idyllisches Dorf, a favourite phrase in property and travel ads. Die Idylle is an idyll, and also ironically a false peace: die Vorstadtidylle trügt (suburban bliss is deceptive). Synonyms: malerisch (picturesque), beschaulich (tranquil), lauschig (snug). Opposite: trostlos (bleak)."
